PRINCIPAL

  Maulana Amratulloh
  Inventor & Chief Architect

  Sole originator of the formal system, its mathematical foundations, and the
  computational architecture derived from them. This designation covers the
  work in its entirety:

    · Matematika Hijaiyyah — the formal system and its axiomatic foundations
    · Master Table HM-28 — the sealed 28 x 18 canonical dataset
    · Codex 14D / 18D — the integer vector representation
    · Guard System G1-G4, T1-T2 — intrinsic O(1) validation
    · Metrik-Vektorial Hijaiyyah — VTM, NMV, AGM, ITM, EXM
    · Hybit — the constrained commutative monoid and its paradigm
    · H-ISA, HVM, HC language, HCC, HASM, HISAB, HAR
    · HCPU — the silicon architecture and its RTL realization

INSTITUTION

  Yayasan Amratulloh International Academy — HMCL (Hijaiyyah Mathematical Computing Laboratory)
  Indonesian name of HMCL: Laboratorium Komputasi Matematis Hijaiyyah

  The foundation is the legal entity of record, established by notarial deed.
  It runs Akademi Hijaiyyah Indonesia, whose legal standing follows the
  foundation, and publishes Edisi I and Edisi II through its publishing unit,
  AMRA Publishing. HMCL continues as its research unit; technical and RTL work
  is attributed there.

      www.akademihijaiyyahindonesia.com

RIGHTS

  Maulana Amratulloh
  Founder and Ketua Pembina (chair of the board of patrons) of
  Yayasan Amratulloh International Academy.

  All patents and intellectual property in this repository are held by him
  personally. The foundation publishes and institutionally sponsors the work;
  it does not hold the rights. This separation is deliberate and must survive
  every edit to the documents below.

